  "scientific_conclusion": [
    "The train-only bounded logit likelihood improves fixed-step validation NLL and all three extreme-tail diagnostics relative to V48 in TNG100, SIMBA, and Swift, while preserving high-k power and residual RMS in every domain.",
    "The repair remains insufficient: q99.999 is high by 0.24 to 0.37 dex, generated maxima exceed truth maxima by 1.32 to 1.44 dex, and physical mean delta squared is high by factors 4.68 to 23.99.",
    "TNG100 and SIMBA fail only the frozen all-scale two-point improvement field check; Swift passes all eight field checks. The common failure is therefore the frozen Q3/Q4 extreme calibration, not loss of the stochastic field body.",
    "The frozen next branch is a train-only audit of occupancy near both fixed support boundaries and bounded-likelihood PIT. Neither support, gate thresholds, generator, nor any independent data may change during that audit."
